  "abstract": "This submission is a direct replication of Ariadne I's 'strong Factorized Global MLP' (ID 247). This model serves as a crucial baseline for our 'Horizon Gating Generalization Deep Dive' project. It features a two-layer MLP for factors, ResidualCopyHead, LayerNorm, U matrix normalization, and uses AdamW with temporal curvature loss. A successful replication establishes a robust foundation for testing the learnable gamma ramp on a complex MLP backbone.",
